# compensAID QC

## Patient summary

```{r}
#| label: patient-compensaid-summary

if (is.null(patient_compensaid_results)) {
  cat("Patient compensAID results are unavailable.")
} else {
  knitr::kable(patient_compensaid_summary)
}
```

## Patient flagged pairs

```{r}
#| label: patient-compensaid-flags

if (
  is.null(patient_compensaid_results) ||
    !any(patient_compensaid_summary$flagged_pairs > 0)
) {
  cat("✅ No patient samples contain flagged SSI pairs.")
} else {
  patient_flagged_pairs <- purrr::imap_dfr(
    patient_compensaid_results,
    function(result, sample_name) {
      if (
        is.null(result$flagged_pairs) ||
          nrow(result$flagged_pairs) == 0
      ) {
        return(tibble::tibble())
      }

      result$flagged_pairs |>
        dplyr::mutate(sample = sample_name, .before = 1)
    }
  )

  knitr::kable(patient_flagged_pairs)
}
```

## Patient compensAID diagnostic plots

```{r}
#| label: patient-compensaid-plots
#| results: asis

if (is.null(patient_compensaid_results)) {
  cat("Patient compensAID results are unavailable.")
} else {
  flagged_samples <- patient_compensaid_results[
    purrr::map_lgl(
      patient_compensaid_results,
      function(result) {
        !is.null(result$compensaid_plots) &&
          length(result$compensaid_plots) > 0
      }
    )
  ]

  if (length(flagged_samples) == 0) {
    cat("No patient diagnostic plots were generated.")
  } else {
    purrr::iwalk(
      flagged_samples,
      function(result, sample_name) {
        cat("\n### ", sample_name, "\n\n", sep = "")

        purrr::iwalk(
          result$compensaid_plots,
          function(plot_object, plot_index) {
            cat(
              "\nDiagnostic plot ",
              plot_index,
              "\n\n",
              sep = ""
            )

            print(plot_object)
          }
        )
      }
    )
  }
}
```

## Control summary

```{r}
#| label: controls-compensaid-summary

if (is.null(controls_compensaid_results)) {
  cat("Control compensAID results are unavailable.")
} else if (length(controls_compensaid_results) == 0) {
  cat("No control compensAID results were generated.")
} else {
  knitr::kable(controls_compensaid_summary)
}
```

# Review checklist

Use this checklist during review:

- [ ] Pipeline completed without a fatal error.
- [ ] All expected patient samples are present in the input inventory.
- [ ] Patient unstained samples are available for the intended patient samples.
- [ ] AF extraction flags have been reviewed.
- [ ] Patient unmixing flags and failures have been reviewed.
- [ ] Nonpatient unmixing failures have been reviewed.
- [ ] Patient cleanup gates appear appropriate.
- [ ] Control cleanup gates appear appropriate.
- [ ] Event populations are plausible after cleanup gating.
- [ ] compensAID flagged pairs have been reviewed.

